      <p source="#source-243-263"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-243-258"><rb>父</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258-263">よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-263-301"><seg source="#source-263-275">おいらも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-275-287"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287-301">きてえな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-301-333"><seg source="#source-301-333">大きな海のまんなかで</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-333-389"><seg source="#source-333-345">おいらも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-345-363"><rb>鰹</rb><rt>かつを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-363-389">が釣つてみてえな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-389-426"><seg source="#source-389-426">おいらも船にのりてえな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-426-440"><seg source="#source-426-440">まつてろ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-440-454"><seg source="#source-440-454">まつてろ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-454-511"><seg source="#source-454-466">その腕が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466-481"><rb>樫</rb><rt>かし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-481-511">の木のやうになるまで</seg></p>
    </body>
